      "category": "Text",
      "text": "a) **Creation.** A new New York City Council Against Poverty is created, the council created by Title I of Executive Order No. 160 of June 30, 1965, as amended by Executive Order No. 163 of July 1, 1965, is abolished, and Title I of Executive Order No. 160 and Executive Order No. 163 are rescinded.",
